WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
An integrated twelve-3U study. Twelve 4 kg 3U envelopes. Two six-level storage banks. One reusable electromagnetic carrier.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Select. Feed. Capture. A guided lead screw transfers one payload sideways into the Z-indexed lift. The lift holds the payload and captive pallet.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Transfer custody positively. Carrier bayonets and lift grip pins overlap custody at handoff. Prove the destination restraint before releasing the other.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Dock. Prove. Clear. The pallet locks to the carrier. The custody frame withdraws clear of the launch path before the shot is enabled.

5
00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Only the payload departs. The payload departs along +X. The captive pallet remains locked to the carrier through arrest and return to its loading datum.

6
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Evaluate the complete trade. Modeled 1–3 m/s commands. Installed device allocation 156.557 kg. These preplanned mission cases show no advantage over the ideal ground-pretrimmed spring comparator.
